>=0A<h1=20class=3DForewordTitle>Foreword</h1>=0A<p=20class=3DForewordText>I=
SO=20(the=20International=20Organization=20for=20Standardization)=20is=20a=20=
worldwide=20federation=20of=20national=20standards=20bodies=20(ISO=20member=
=20bodies).=20The=20work=20of=20preparing=20International=20Standards=20is=20=
normally=20carried=20out=20through=20ISO=20technical=20committees.=20Each=20=
member=20body=20interested=20in=20a=20subject=20for=20which=20a=20technical=
=20committee=20has=20been=20established=20has=20the=20right=20to=20be=20rep=
resented=20on=20that=20committee.=20International=20organizations,=20govern=
mental=20and=20non-governmental,=20in=20liaison=20with=20ISO,=20also=20take=
=20part=20in=20the=20work.=20ISO=20collaborates=20closely=20with=20the=20In=
ternational=20Electrotechnical=20Commission=20(IEC)=20on=20all=20matters=20=
of=20electrotechnical=20standardization.</p>=0A<p=20class=3DForewordText>Th=
e=20procedures=20used=20to=20develop=20this=20document=20and=20those=20inte=
nded=20for=20its=20further=20maintenance=20are=20described=20in=20the=20ISO=
/IEC=20Directives,=20Part=201.=20In=20particular=20the=20different=20approv=
al=20criteria=20needed=20for=20the=20different=20types=20of=20ISO=20documen=
ts=20should=20be=20noted.=20This=20document=20was=20drafted=20in=20accordan=
ce=20with=20the=20editorial=20rules=20of=20the=20ISO/IEC=20Directives,=20Pa=
rt=202=20(see=20www.iso.org/directives).</p>=0A<p=20class=3DForewordText>At=
tention=20is=20drawn=20to=20the=20possibility=20that=20some=20of=20the=20el=
ements=20of=20this=20document=20may=20be=20the=20subject=20of=20patent=20ri=
ghts.=20ISO=20shall=20not=20be=20held=20responsible=20for=20identifying=20a=
ny=20or=20all=20such=20patent=20rights.=20Details=20of=20any=20patent=20rig=
hts=20identified=20during=20the=20development=20of=20the=20document=20will=20=
be=20in=20the=20Introduction=20and/or=20on=20the=20ISO=20list=20of=20patent=
=20declarations=20received=20(see=20www.iso.org/patents).</p>=0A<p=20class=3D=
ForewordText>Any=20trade=20name=20used=20in=20this=20document=20is=20inform=
ation=20given=20for=20the=20convenience=20of=20users=20and=20does=20not=20c=
onstitute=20an=20endorsement.</p>=0A<p=20class=3DForewordText>For=20an=20ex=
planation=20on=20the=20voluntary=20nature=20of=20standards,=20the=20meaning=
=20of=20ISO=20specific=20terms=20and=20expressions=20related=20to=20conform=
ity=20assessment,=20as=20well=20as=20information=20about=20ISO=E2=80=99s=20=
adherence=20to=20the=20World=20Trade=20Organization=20(WTO)=20principles=20=
in=20the=20Technical=20Barriers=20to=20Trade=20(TBT)=20see=20the=20followin=
g=20URL:=20www.iso.org/iso/foreword.html.</p>=0A<p=20class=3DForewordText>T=
his=20document=20was=20prepared=20by=20Technical=20Committee=20ISO/{technic=
al-committee-type}=2034,=20<i>Food=20products</i>,=20Subcommittee=20SC=204,=
=20<i>Cereals=20and=20pulses</i>.</p>=0A<p=20class=3DForewordText>A=20list=20=
of=20all=20parts=20in=20the=20ISO=2017301=20series=20can=20be=20found=20on=20=
the=20ISO=20website.</p>=0A<p=20class=3DMsoNormal><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>=0A=0A=
</div>=0A=0A<br=20clear=3D"all"=20class=3D"section"=20/>=0A=0A<div=20class=3D=
>=0A=0A<p=20class=3DMainTitle1>Cereals=20and=20pulses=20=E2=80=94=20Specifi=
cation=20and=20test=20methods</p>=0A<p=20class=3DMainTitle2>Part=C2=A01:=20=
Rice=20(CD)</p>=0A<h1=20class=3DMsoHeading1>Introduction</h1>=0A<p=20class=3D=
BodyText>Delete=20the=20fourth=20to=20seventh=20paragraphs.</p>=0A<h1=20cla=
ss=3DMsoHeading1>Normative=20references</h1>=0A<p=20class=3DBodyText>Replac=
e=20the=20reference=20to=20ISO=2016634:=E2=80=94=20(including=20the=20footn=
ote)=20with=20the=20following:</p>=0A<p=20class=3DBodyText>Renumber=20subse=
quent=20footnotes.</p>=0A<p=20class=3Da3>ISO=2016634-2:2016,=20<i>Food=20pr=
oducts=20=E2=80=94=20Determination=20of=20the=20total=20nitrogen=20content=20=
by=20combustion=20according=20to=20the=20Dumas=20principle=20and=20calculat=
ion=20of=20the=20crude=20protein=20content=20=E2=80=94=20Part=202:=20Cereal=
s,=20pulses=20and=20milled=20cereal=20products</i></p>=0A<h1=20class=3DMsoH=
eading1>4.1,=20second=20paragraph</h1>=0A<p=20class=3DBodyText>Replace=20th=
e=20paragraph=20with=20the=20following:</p>=0A<p=20class=3Da3>There=20shall=
=20be=20a=20procedure=20to=20identify=20the=20maximum=20permissible=20level=
s=20for=20additives=20and=20pesticide=20residues=20and=20other=20contaminan=
ts=20in=20the=20country=20of=20destination.</p>=0A<h1=20class=3DMsoHeading1=
>4.2.1</h1>=0A<p=20class=3DBodyText>Designate=20the=20existing=20NOTE=20as=20=
NOTE=201=20and=20add=20the=20following=20new=20NOTE:</p>=0A<p=20class=3DBox=
-begin><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>=0A<p=20class=3DNoteindent>For=20certain=20dest=
inations,=20no=20differentiation=20is=20made=20between=20the=20organic=20an=
d=20inorganic=20mass=20fractions=20of=20extraneous=20matter.</p>=0A<p=20cla=
ss=3DBox-end><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>=0A<h1=20class=3DMsoHeading1>4.2.2,=20Tab=
le=201</h1>=0A<p=20class=3DBodyText>In=20the=20column=20=E2=80=9Cin=20mille=
d=20rice=20(non-glutinous)=E2=80=9D,=20replace=20the=20value=20=E2=80=9C0,3=
=E2=80=9D=20for=20=E2=80=9CPaddy=E2=80=9D=20with=20the=20value=20=E2=80=9C0=
,5=E2=80=9D.</p>=0A<h1=20class=3DMsoHeading1>6.3,=20first=20paragraph</h1>=0A=
<p=20class=3DBodyText>Replace=20the=20reference=20=E2=80=9CISO=2016634:=E2=80=
=94,=20Clause=209=E2=80=9D=20with=20=E2=80=9CISO=2016634-2:2016,=20Clause=20=
9=E2=80=9D.</p>=0A<h1=20class=3DMsoHeading1>Clause=208</h1>=0A<p=20class=3D=
BodyText>Add=20the=20following=20paragraph=20at=20the=20end=20of=20the=20cl=
ause:</p>=0A<p=20class=3Da3>Annex=20E=20gives=20recommendations=20relating=20=
to=20storage=20and=20transport=20conditions.</p>=0A<h1=20class=3DMsoHeading=
1>Clause=209</h1>=0A<p=20class=3DBodyText>Replace=20the=20text=20with=20the=
=20following:</p>=0A<p=20class=3Da3>The=20marking=20on=20the=20packages=20s=
hall=20clearly=20identify=20the=20type=20of=20rice.</p>=0A<h1=20class=3DMso=
Heading1>A.2.1</h1>=0A<p=20class=3DBodyText>Replace=20the=20text=20with=20t=
he=20following:</p>=0A<p=20class=3Da3><b>A.2.1=20Sample=20divider</b>,=20co=
nsisting=20of=20a=20conical=20sample=20divider=20or=20multiple-slot=20sampl=
e=20divider=20with=20a=20distribution=20system,=20e.g.=20conical=20(Boerner=
-type)=20divider=20such=20as=20that=20shown=20in=20Figure=20A.1=20or=20mult=
iple-slot=20(riffle-type)=20divider=20such=20as=20that=20shown=20in=20Figur=
e=20A.2.</p>=0A<h1=20class=3DMsoHeading1>Figure=20A.1</h1>=0A<p=20class=3DB=
odyText>Replace=20Figure=20A.1=20with=20the=20following=20two=20figures:</p=
>=0A<p=20class=3DFigureGraphic><img=20src=3D"media/img20261105-397-2mpa1z.p=
ng"=20style=3D'width:420px;height:615px'></p>=0A<p=20class=3DFiguretitle>Co=
nical=20(Boerner-type)=20divider</p>=0A<p=20class=3DKeyTitle>1</p>=0A<p=20c=
lass=3DKeyText>funnel=20</p>=0A<p=20class=3DKeyTitle>2</p>=0A<p=20class=3DK=
eyText>collection=20boxes=20</p>=0A<p=20class=3DFigureGraphic><img=20src=3D=
"media/img20261105-397-tbiv5m.png"=20style=3D'width:609px;height:577px'></p=
>=0A<p=20class=3DFiguretitle>Multiple-slot=20(riffle-type)=20divider=20with=
=20two=20collection=20boxes</p>=0A<p=20class=3DKeyTitle>1</p>=0A<p=20class=3D=
KeyText>slots=20</p>=0A<p=20class=3DKeyTitle>2</p>=0A<p=20class=3DKeyText>c=
ollection=20boxes=20</p>=0A<h1=20class=3DMsoHeading1>Annex=20E</h1>=0A<p=20=
class=3DBodyText>Add=20the=20following=20annex=20after=20Annex=20D,=20befor=
e=20the=20Bibliography.</p>=0A<h2=20class=3DMsoHeading2>Recommendations=20r=
elating=20to=20storage=20and=20storage=20and=20transport=20conditions</h2>=0A=
<p=20class=3Da3>Containers=20of=20rice=20should=20be=20stored=20in=20covere=
d=20premises,=20well=20protected=20from=20the=20sun,=20rain=20and=20excessi=
ve=20heat.</p>=0A<p=20class=3Da3>The=20storeroom=20should=20be=20dry,=20fre=
e=20from=20unpleasant=20odours=20and=20protected=20against=20entry=20of=20i=
nsects=20and=20other=20vermin.=20Ventilation=20should=20be=20adjusted=20in=20=
such=20a=20way=20as=20to=20give=20good=20ventilation=20during=20dry=20weath=
er=20and=20to=20be=20fully=20closed=20under=20damp=20conditions.=20Suitable=
=20provisions=20should=20be=20made=20for=20fumigation=20of=20storerooms.</p=
>=0A<p=20class=3Da3>Containers=20should=20be=20handled=20and=20transported=20=
in=20such=20a=20way=20that=20they=20are=20protected=20from=20the=20rain,=20=
sun=20or=20other=20sources=20of=20excessive=20heat,=20unpleasant=20odours=20=
and=20any=20other=20contamination=20(especially=20in=20the=20holds=20of=20s=
hips).</p>=0A=0A=0A</div>=0A=0A</body>=0A</html>=0A
